{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type HotkeyCallback = (event, context) => void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L233","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hotkey.types.ts:233"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Callback function type for hotkey handlers."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"event","children":[{"type":"text","value":"event"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"KeyboardEvent"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The keyboard event that triggered the hotkey"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"context","children":[{"type":"text","value":"context"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/HotkeyCallbackContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HotkeyCallbackContext"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Additional context including the hotkey and parsed hotkey"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const handler: HotkeyCallback = (event, { hotkey, parsedHotkey }) => {\n  console.log(`Hotkey ${hotkey} was pressed`)\n  console.log(`Modifiers:`, parsedHotkey.modifiers)\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"event","text":"event","level":3},{"id":"context","text":"context","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype HotkeyCallback = (event, context) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:233](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L233)\n\nCallback function type for hotkey handlers.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### event\n\n`KeyboardEvent`\n\nThe keyboard event that triggered the hotkey\n\n### context\n\n[`HotkeyCallbackContext`](../interfaces/HotkeyCallbackContext.md)\n\nAdditional context including the hotkey and parsed hotkey\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst handler: HotkeyCallback = (event, { hotkey, parsedHotkey }) => {\n  console.log(`Hotkey ${hotkey} was pressed`)\n  console.log(`Modifiers:`, parsedHotkey.modifiers)\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: HotkeyCallback\ntitle: HotkeyCallback\n---\n\n```ts\ntype HotkeyCallback = (event, context) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:233](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L233)\n\nCallback function type for hotkey handlers.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### event\n\n`KeyboardEvent`\n\nThe keyboard event that triggered the hotkey\n\n### context\n\n[`HotkeyCallbackContext`](../interfaces/HotkeyCallbackContext.md)\n\nAdditional context including the hotkey and parsed hotkey\n\n## Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst handler: HotkeyCallback = (event, { hotkey, parsedHotkey }) => {\n  console.log(`Hotkey ${hotkey} was pressed`)\n  console.log(`Modifiers:`, parsedHotkey.modifiers)\n}\n```\n"}
